Drag and drop lets users reorder rows and move them between lists. This
page brings together the design guidance and the implementation of the
`sortable-lists` controller suite.

Start with **Design guidance** for interaction decisions. To implement drag
and drop, choose **Implementation overview** in the [tabs below](#page-tabbed-sections),
then **One list**, **Sibling lists** or **Nested lists** for your scenario.
**API reference** covers the attributes, request and response contract, and
migration from `generic-drag-and-drop`.
